      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "Use this dashboard after the operations overview shows latency or saturation that is not explained by caller errors.\n\n1. Start with inflight work and DB pool pressure.\n2. Check goroutines, threads, CPU, and memory for local process saturation.\n3. Use GC and file descriptor panels to separate runtime pressure from external dependency latency.\n4. These are pod/process-level signals; in production scrape discovery should keep `instance` labels for each replica.",
